From ddfb74423ff9f380418240f25ae549d2768c2b1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:35:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): group non-chat blocked cards by creator
 [daveey]

A successful session-label lookup omits internal runtime sessions, but the sidebar retained their ids as phantom chats. Distinguish an omitted label from an unavailable endpoint, preserve genuine untitled sessions and older-backend raw-id fallback, and group sessionless cards by creator and gateway with drawer navigation.

Proof: focused regression RED then GREEN; Desktop full typecheck passes; all kanban plugin tests pass (24 files, 192 tests); eslint passes; scripts/check --base origin/main passes all 21 checks. Four source mutants killed: omitted-label manager retention, missing endpoint fallback removal, creator-key omission and gateway-key omission.
